# Screen recordings. `git add -A` put 211MB of takes into the film repo twice on
# 2026-07-30, because a rule written as public/device/*.mp4 does not reach into a
# subdirectory. This repo has never held a video and none belongs in it: the film
# lives in stakes-pitch-video. These patterns carry no slash, so they match at every
# level. Nothing here touches images on purpose — public/screens/*.png is served.
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.webm
*.avi

